     1177     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-issuer-hdl AS HANDLE    NO-UNDO.
     1178     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-state      AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.
     1179     CASE p-state:
     1180     END CASE.
     1181     END PROCEDURE.
